# Formerly pinned 0 1 0, r 1 by the rule R89, opening is an attempt (lmx_graph_receiver_opened: a one-field
# Structure opens nothing). by the book, #declaration-selection, W and E are equal candidates; the former rule (R89) no longer holds: W -- C whole to the form [code] -- and E -- the
# one field Inner, a name read as an actual: the Structure Inner, to [code] -- both resolve call(C): ambiguity 3
# (book #selection-examples, the row «W и E подходят одному объявлению»); nothing runs and the next line is not reached: seen 0,
# r 0. Derived before the run (opus, step 21.5; fable Р130).
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: r 0
)
@: shared data[0]

sub: main (Inner(shared\Observed\seen := 5); C(Inner))
    call(C)
    shared\Observed\r := 1
main()
